        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing in store service from Richard, made buying a new mattress super simple and easy. The delivery was done with care and the driver/helper combo were amazing.",
        "time": 1748087524,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andre Maillet",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114903177039616111203/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ7u83jaZoSXbjxzCZkFM8p7904zQ_8TySNkakan2_5THdVRw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Great service and delivery. Top notch all around.\n\nSales team know more about mattresses than I’ll ever know about anything. Delivery guys were in and out. No more waiting on delivery without any clue of time. Texts received kept me up to date and could even track the drivers.  Very cool",
